==Description==
The '''Charge''' is an item which can be picked up by the player to power the [[Star Cannon]]. It appears in [[Totality Tower]] as part of the [[Solar Eclipse Event]] and in [[Blind Faith]] as part of the [[Null & Void Event]].

In [[Totality Tower]], '''Charges''' appeared all around the map once Wave 16 was reached, while in [[Blind Faith]] they appear once the [[Star Cannon]] has been rebuilt. It takes three '''Charges''' to active the [[Star Cannon]].

==Appearance==
{{Tabber
